	(text "04 Measurement (fifth pass, IF-2.3): one ADS7056 (14 bit, 2.5 MSPS) behind an 8:1 multiplexer (TMUX1308); the counter U4xx steps the channel on every CS_FAST falling edge (the sample instant), so the buffer settles during the next conversion frame. Channel order (count 0-7): V_ANODE, I_C14, I_Q12, RAW, V_SCREEN, I_C24, I_Q22, bias (zero reference). MUX_CLR_N (pad 11) restarts at 0, MUX_HOLD_N (pad 13) holds the channel. No slow converter: UC1 is no longer monitored."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "893b8873-ee11-50a1-a386-b7e515d55d79")
	)
